</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS7" title="In IV Results ‣ Collaborative Loco-Manipulation for Pick-and-Place Tasks with Dynamic Reward Curriculum" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-G</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Limitations</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
